          "filename": "Youtubeheadquarters.jpg",
          "caption": "Until October 2006, the en:headquarters of en:YouTube were on the second floor of this modest brick building in downtown en:San Mateo, California.   The first floor is occupied by a pizzeria and a Japanese restaurant.  The YouTube entrance is the small door between the two restaurants.  \nRight before YouTube agreed to become part of Google, it moved out of the loft and into a real office building in nearby en:San Bruno, California.\n\nPhotographed by user Coolcaesar on en:October 2, en:2006.",
